# Lighthouse CI's local output. `npx lhci autorun` writes reports here on every
# run; they are a measurement of one machine at one moment, and the numbers
# worth keeping go into docs/HANDOVER.md with a date on them. Left untracked,
# they also fail `format:check`, which is how this entry came to exist.
.lighthouseci/

# Claude Code session-local settings and task locks — per-machine, not shared.
.claude/
